__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.model_cache/
models/
.playwright-cli/
.pylibs/
.venv*/
backup*/
*.log
test_results/**/*.wav
output/**/*.zip
output/**/*.log
config/game_profile_selection.json
config/game_profile_selection.json.v1.bak
# Portable release staging: ~200 MB of bundled Python, models and native DLLs.
build/

# Cloud service local state. The database is developer data, and cloud.db in
# particular holds password hashes and session rows -- never commit it.
cloud/*.db
cloud/*.db-journal
cloud/*.db-wal
cloud/*.db-shm

# output/ is scratch: capture data, replay dumps, review screenshots. The two
# narrower rules above predate the directory filling up; this covers the rest.
# Anything here that turns out to be worth keeping belongs in docs/ or tests/
# with an explanation, not in a folder tools write to.
output/

# 指向网页包签名私钥的位置。路径本身不是秘密，但没必要写进公开历史。
config/phone_web_signing_key.txt

# 部署时由 push.sh 从 build/app_bundle 复制过来的电脑端更新包。
# 是构建产物，不进仓库——它就是 app/ 的一份拷贝。
cloud/app_bundle/
